            withdrawn and cut again keeps every one"
    claim "C5" from-slice="TS.260821.13" state="met" \
        evidence="a-state-vocabulary-is-declared-once refuses and is WITNESSED (21 of 49). \
            tests/withdrawing.rs::a_kind_declaring_its_states_twice_differently_is_refused asserts \
            the message names what is only in each, and that agreement is silent"

    layer "doctrine"    state="evidenced" \
        evidence="skills/cut-the-version and the release node's own header say a cut is a pointer; \
